{"v":1,"duration":51.72,"text":"One quiet night, Norden lay in bed with his country book beside him. He had been thinking about countries all day. Norway was his favorite. Argentina was number two. And of course he loved the United States too. But Norden had a question. How can there be so many countries in one world? Suddenly his country book began to glow. A tiny blue door appeared on the first page with the flag of Norway on it. Norden touched it. And suddenly he was standing beside a beautiful Norwegian fjord, surrounded by enormous mountains and sparkling water.","starts":[0.125,0.25,0.375,0.5,0.56,0.62,0.68,0.74,0.8,0.86,0.937,1.014,1.091,1.169,1.246,1.323,2.18,2.246,2.312,2.377,2.443,2.509,2.574,2.64,2.715,2.79,2.865,2.94,3,3.06,3.12,3.19,3.26,3.33,3.4,3.456,3.512,3.568,3.624,3.68,3.72,3.76,3.8,3.84,3.88,3.92,3.96,4,4.04,4.08,4.12,4.16,4.216,4.272,4.328,4.384,4.44,4.5,4.56,4.62,4.68,4.74,4.8,4.86,4.932,5.004,5.076,5.148,6.2,6.347,6.493,6.64,6.665,6.69,6.715,6.74,6.772,6.804,6.836,6.868,6.9,6.942,6.984,7.027,7.069,7.111,7.153,7.196,7.238,7.28,7.34,7.4,7.46,7.52,7.58,7.64,7.692,7.744,7.796,7.848,7.9,7.952,8.004,8.056,8.108,8.16,8.25,8.34,8.43,8.52,8.588,8.656,8.724,8.792,10.1,10.191,10.283,10.374,10.466,10.557,10.649,10.74,10.89,11.04,11.19,11.34,11.39,11.44,11.49,11.54,11.58,11.62,11.66,11.7,11.74,11.78,11.82,11.86,11.9,13.2,13.252,13.304,13.356,13.408,13.46,13.512,13.564,13.616,13.668,13.72,13.92,14.12,14.32,14.52,14.557,14.594,14.631,14.669,14.706,14.743,14.78,14.864,14.948,15.032,15.116,16.26,16.355,16.45,16.545,16.64,16.68,16.72,16.76,16.803,16.846,16.889,16.931,16.974,17.017,17.06,17.16,17.26,17.36,17.417,17.473,17.53,17.587,17.643,17.7,17.765,17.83,17.895,17.96,17.994,18.029,18.063,18.097,18.131,18.166,18.2,18.286,18.371,18.457,18.543,18.629,18.714,18.8,18.872,18.944,19.016,19.088,20.16,20.25,20.34,20.43,20.52,20.594,20.668,20.743,20.817,20.891,20.966,21.04,21.14,21.24,21.34,21.44,21.5,21.56,21.594,21.628,21.662,21.696,21.73,21.764,21.798,21.832,21.866,2